<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60156" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρότᾰφ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>side of the forehead</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.502
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.397
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				854
			</span></i>: mostly in pl., <i>temples</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.188
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.187
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶτον ἴουλον ἀπὸ κροτάφων καταβάλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					15.85
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).1355
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Abia</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς κ. πολιοῦνται πρῶτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					784b35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>side edge, profile</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Hyp.</u>
				3.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλου</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>; of a brick, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.30
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ κρόταφον</span>
			<i>sideways, horizontally</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				98.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				64.25
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				60.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ κρορόταφον</span>
			<i>on its side</i>,  ib.<i><span class="en">
				66.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>slope</i> of a mountain, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				721
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ κροτάφοις
			Ἑλικῶνος</span> Philiadasap.<i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θέσπεια</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>back of a book</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>edge</i> or <i>narrow side</i> of a stele, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).109
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				 iii 162
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				 iv 129
			</span></i> (Epid.). (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρταφος</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				541.23
			</span></i>, <u>Et.Gud.</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Zonar.
			</span></i>, prob. to be read in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				84
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κότραφος</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Osl.</u>
				1.152
			</span></i>, etc.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
